  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.102\n\nReleased on 2026-10-01.\n\nHost apps can change layer order the same way Studio's canvas menu does. Moving a layer that only fades no longer hands GSAP an element it does not position.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Studio:** Hosts can apply the canvas menu's z-order through useDomEditZOrder ([c0f2780b8](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c0f2780b8e76f3e026dd05e03a6e9f686f2f15e9), [#4793](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4793)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Studio:** The properties panel no longer hands GSAP an element it does not position ([4c768186b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4c768186b83a1c0c4eb3d310269856c7a5f28664), [#4830](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/4830)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.101...v0.8.102\n"
